.git
# Phase 5 fix: .venv itself was never excluded (only oddly-named
# .venv_inspect/.venv_validate were) -- the entire local virtual environment
# (pandas/numpy/scikit-learn/lightgbm/shap/numba+llvmlite/scipy/matplotlib/
# fastapi/... easily 1-3GB) was being sent to the Docker daemon as build
# context on every single build. This is what made every docker compose
# build in this repo dramatically slower than it needed to be.
.venv/
.venv_inspect
.venv_validate
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.env
backend/.env
backend/db.sqlite3.bak
ml/notebooks/.ipynb_checkpoints
docs/thesis
*.md
# Regenerated by ml.src.generator.cli, not needed inside the image -- the
# app reads it from a mounted volume/regenerates it, never bakes it in.
data/synthetic/*.jsonl
data/synthetic/*.csv
